#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. 今は校章が浮かんでいるだけだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on.\n"
"Right now, it's just showing the school crest.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. これも、壊したら…罰があるのかもな…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "If I break it...Monokuma might come and punish *me*."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>監視カメラ…
#. こんなカメラで…見てるのか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A surveillance camera... They're always watching...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ムカツクけど、放っておくしかない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>As much as it gets on my nerves, I'd better leave it\n"
"alone.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>エロいグラビアの<CLT><CLT 3>ポスター<CLT><CLT 4>だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a <CLT><CLT 3>poster<CLT><CLT 4> of a sexy model...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>一応、ここも学校内なのに…
#. こういうの、張っちゃっていいのかな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Obviously someone put this in the school, but...is it\n"
"really okay to have something like this here?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0007 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0008 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>男子更衣室から出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the boys locker room?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
